  "gaps": [],
  "prose": {
    "summary": "Ultralight CMS is modeled as one #ABS abstraction containing four #FILE Nodes. index.html owns EVENT_OPEN_PAGE and FUNCTION_OPEN_PAGE. open_page calls renderer.js render_page; render_page calls read_content and read_style; those reader Functions explicitly consume content.json and style.css data surfaces.",
    "notes": "The older .cw labels shown in the historical diagram are represented here by the actual implementation identities index.html, renderer.js, content.json and style.css. This revision fixes canonical Function/Event structure only; renderer animation behavior is intentionally outside this example revision."
  }
